+gives $\mathcal E_{\ell,h}\ge|h|(|h|-1)-|h|/2$.
+
+(h) Row $\ell$ of $\Lambda^{-1}E\Lambda$ is the sum, over all $h\ne0$, of the
+positive terms $e^{-\pi\alpha^2\mathcal E_{\ell,h}}$; the terms with
