+Under these hypotheses put $\mathsf J=N^{-1}/2^{L+2}$, so that
+$\|\mathsf J\|\le0.251$.
+\begin{enumerate}
+\item A fixed multitape algorithm, given $p,s,t,\alpha$, writes a factor
