+analysis. As $\Lambda$ has diagonal entries in $[1,R]$ and $R\le2^L$, an
+entrywise perturbation of size $\eta$ has scaled entries at most $2^L\eta$, and
+$\|y_\Lambda\|\le\|y\|\le2^L\|y_\Lambda\|$.
