+$(E_m)_\Lambda$ has row sums at most $\rho_2$, and as $\alpha^2m^2\ge w$ and
+$\pi\log_2e>1$, $\|(E-E_m)_\Lambda\|<3e^{-\pi w}<3\cdot2^{-w}$.
